  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/sn5gHNg.png\" width=\"638\" height=\"359\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#0cf\"><strong>&darr;&darr;&darr; 点击此处访问我们的新网站&nbsp;&darr;&darr;&darr;</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-zero\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/VVAjDy4.png\" width=\"324\" height=\"242\"></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>永恒与经典零版：<span style=\"color:#0cf\">完全重制的TaC</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f60\"><strong>支持 1.20.1 版本</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #cccccc;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif\"><span><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>枪械、动画、写实、有趣，Timeless风格打造。</strong></span></span></span></div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/TpY148q.png\" width=\"100\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">支持我们的工作&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f90\"><a style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f90\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/ClumsyAlienDev\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a></span>，以及国内玩家可支持&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:24px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fafdian.net%252fa%252fnekocrane\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#0cf\">爱发电</span>,</a>&nbsp;您的支持将帮助我们持续开发！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/4ulvgSx.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#000\"><strong>新增内容...</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#f0f\"><strong>50</strong><strong style=\"font-size:24px\">种枪械</strong></span>，每种枪械都拥有独立的<strong>性能</strong>、<strong>品级</strong>、<strong>模型</strong>以及<strong>自定义功能<img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/JNXc4dp.png\" width=\"533\" height=\"266\"></strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#f60\"><strong>配件</strong></span>, 通</span><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#000\">过</span>丰富的<strong>瞄准镜</strong>、<strong>枪口</strong>、<strong>弹匣</strong>、<strong>握把</strong>和<strong>枪托</strong>来改装你的武器</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/UfIMIwX.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"535\" height=\"232\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#3cc\"><strong>外观</strong></span>, 更</span><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\">改</span>武器的<strong>颜色</strong>和<strong>模型</strong>！<img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/b5d4Pzc.png\" width=\"538\" height=\"354\"></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#f60\"><strong>自定义性</strong></span>, 武器的各项数据可通过本地/服务器<strong>数据包</strong>进行修改，其外观和声音也可通过<strong>资源包</strong>进行更改！<img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/VI18nxl.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"532\" height=\"290\"></span></li>\n</ul>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#008080\"><strong>*相关链接：</strong></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#000\">兼容<span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yes-steve-model\" rel=\"nofollow\">Yes, Steve model mod</a></span>模组，提供独特的第三人称动画！</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#000\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/GQZdzk5.png\" width=\"345\" height=\"201\"></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#000\">社区扩展包：</span></span><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-guns-lesraisins-append-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:600\">LesRaisins Append Pack</span></a></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</div>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>安装指南</strong></span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;color:#000\"><strong>必须安装<span style=\"color:#f00\">（强制）</span>:</strong>&nbsp;在游玩任何<strong>TaC&nbsp;</strong>版本前，请先安装模组<a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;color:#000\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obfuscate/files/3740120\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:24px\">Obfuscate</span>&nbsp;</strong></a>（MC1.18.2版本请使用<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/framework\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00;text-decoration:underline\">Framework</span></strong></span></a>），建议安装最新版本！</span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;color:#000\"><strong>必须安装<span style=\"color:#f60\">（低于0.3.9版本）</span><strong>&nbsp;</strong>:</strong>&nbsp;模组<span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios/files/3661903\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong style=\"font-size:24px\">Curios</strong></a></span></span>！<strong>&nbsp;为使护甲装备正确运行，必须</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong><strong>严格</strong> </strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;color:#000\"><strong>使用<span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong style=\"font-size:24px\">4.0.8.1</strong></span></strong>版本！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 自0.3.10版本起不再需要Curios！</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>关于MC1.18.2的0.3.10测试版</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">此为测试版，可能存在不可预知的Bug，请自行权衡风险后安装</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&middot; 不再需要Curios。同时也不再需要Obfuscate，改为安装<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/framework\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#f00\">Framework</span></a>。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&middot; 游戏内调整配置的界面存在Bug，目前仍在修复中，已暂时移除。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&middot; 护甲装备系统回归，使用快捷键（默认O键）进行装备/卸下。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&middot; 瞄具放大算法已修改，但双重渲染时的放大效果出现异常。需要在 config/tac-client.toml 中将 scopeDoubleRender 设置为 false。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&middot; 因功能调整需求，0.3.9更新的外观系统已暂时移除。仅保留外观物品，但实际不会生效。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&middot; 若使用OptiFine，请下载并使用“tac-a-0.3.10-1.18.2-optifine.jar”文件，否则游戏将会崩溃。</strong></span></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>枪械动画示例（约0.3.2版本）</strong></span></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/syT0p51WaHc\" height=\"838\" width=\"838\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>其他链接：</strong></span><br> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/rDztDFArgH\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://assets-global.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/636e0a69f118df70ad7828d4_icon_clyde_blurple_RGB.svg\" width=\"109\" height=\"82\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBPg0qLkNV6MzHinm0CmaYQ\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.freeiconspng.com/uploads/youtube-icon-app-logo-png-9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"111\" height=\"99\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/ClumsyAlienDev\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/NtIKbwU.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"99\" height=\"99\"></a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.mcbbs.net%252fforum.php%253fmod%253dviewthread%2526tid%253d1264237\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/NpTMSPo.png\" alt=\"https://imgur.com/NpTMSPo.png\" width=\"279\" height=\"95\"></a>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;color:#f90\"><em><strong>主要开发者：</strong></em></span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\"><strong style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">ClumsyAlien</strong></span><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#f00\">&nbsp;</span>（Java开发 / 创始人）</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\"><strong style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">NekoCrane</strong></span><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#f00\">&nbsp;</span>（首席美术 / 创始人）Twitter: @CraneNeko</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>Receke</strong>（美术）</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>Mayday</strong>（动画开发 / Java开发）</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>alex_n_italy</strong>（美术）</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">Hatt</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;（美术）</span></span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>Mecha</strong>（美术）</span></span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">Pos_2333</strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">&nbsp;（美术）</span><br> <strong style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">Spacebar</strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">&nbsp;（首席动画设计师）</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Mr_K</strong>&nbsp;（动画设计师）</span><br> <strong style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">IronCurtain</strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">&nbsp;（音效工程师）</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>Gaint_Salted_Fish&nbsp;</strong>（Java开发）<br><strong>Chris Linefield&nbsp;</strong>（Java开发）<br></span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">TaoismDeepLake</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">（Java开发）</span></span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong><strong>Fiz</strong>&nbsp;</strong>（Java开发 / 数据科学家）</span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;<img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/uX3xub8.png\" width=\"640\" height=\"361\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><em><strong>贡献者：</strong></em></span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Kacper</strong>（音效工程师 / 辅助建模师）</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>OddlyDelta</strong>&nbsp;（动画师）Twitter: @OddlyDelta</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Bomb787</strong>（Java开发 / 枪械“专家”）</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>Danny</strong>（建模师）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>DarkSoul38 </strong>（建模师）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">LesRaisins Studio </span></strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">（扩展包开发）</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
